                            	   236: ; Blitter block copy, HOP 2 / OP 3, no skew, all endmasks $ffff: a0 source, a1 destination, d0 words per line,
                            	   237: ; d1 lines, d2 bytes from the end of a line to the start of the next one (source and destination alike).
